# AI coding assistant directories
# This repo gets worked on with several assistants; none of their local
# state belongs in a public repo. .claude/ already exists in the working
# tree holding only empty directories, so git has been ignoring it by
# default so far — that stops being true the moment anything writes a
# file into it.
.claude/
.cursor/
.continue/
.aider*
.superpowers/

# Jekyll build output
# This is a GitHub Pages repo. GitHub's own build ignores these, but a
# locally built _site/ committed by accident is a classic, noisy mistake
# in a docs repo, especially with PRs open from outside contributors.
_site/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
.sass-cache/
vendor/bundle/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
